While playing PC HACK (1.0.3), I was teleported to a vault (no exits, just
gold).  Having nothing to teleport me out, I # PRAYed.  I female appeared
at a door which had not previously existed (I had searched for quite some
time for one).  She asked me my name, and I replied.  She said that she
did not know me, but asked me to follow her.  I new hall appeared and
I followed her down it.  After reaching a previously existing hall, both
the female and the new hall disappeared, not to be found again.  Prayer
did not do anything in any other life-threatening situations, and I did
not get a chance to see if it would work again in the vault.
     
It would be interesting to find out exactly what prayer will do.
     
By the way, I don't remember how I knew she was female.. something she
said indicated it.
     
